      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think You'd be better off with a limited time frame, maybe a few hours. Right now Quest and PC are two different uploads and I've noticed that doing either increases the version.\n\nPersonally I'd like to see the avatars uploaded to the creators account and then access shared, like ready player me does, but any idea in the right direction (easier and safer for people apply money to creators) is worth support.",
